WEBVTT

01:20.990 --> 01:26.700
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.460 --> 01:29.789
[Episode 15]

01:29.970 --> 01:39.440
[Memorial]

01:46.120 --> 01:47.120
My mother

01:48.090 --> 01:49.560
asked me to pass along a few words

01:49.560 --> 01:50.759
to Miss Gu.

01:53.680 --> 01:54.310
Rong,

01:55.200 --> 01:55.920
Lan,

01:56.440 --> 01:59.759
[Memorial]

01:56.509 --> 01:57.380
come with me.

02:12.750 --> 02:13.710
Are you alright?

02:14.750 --> 02:15.800
I'm fine.

02:19.150 --> 02:20.810
I'm sorry your mother is gone.

02:21.000 --> 02:22.030
Miss Gu, I hope you

02:22.750 --> 02:24.079
accept my condolences,

02:25.120 --> 02:26.400
and take care of yourself.

02:26.400 --> 02:28.930
That is the best way
to honor your late mother.

02:30.870 --> 02:31.630
I know.

02:34.079 --> 02:36.000
I heard the Old Madam came as well.

02:39.000 --> 02:40.329
She arrived yesterday.

02:41.310 --> 02:43.310
She wasn't feeling well last night,

02:43.910 --> 02:44.870
and today

02:45.400 --> 02:46.930
she couldn't get out of bed.

02:47.430 --> 02:49.030
Did you send for a physician?

02:49.190 --> 02:50.280
Yes.

02:51.000 --> 02:52.260
It's nothing serious.

02:53.560 --> 02:55.560
She's just overwhelmed with grief.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.900
When will the funeral be held?

03:01.590 --> 03:02.710
Not yet.

03:03.030 --> 03:04.430
My mother's last wish was

03:05.080 --> 03:08.340
to be buried in the Ji family
ancestral ground in Tongzhou.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.490
Did the Gu family

03:10.840 --> 03:11.870
agree to that?

03:13.800 --> 03:15.460
That's not for them to decide.

03:17.870 --> 03:19.870
I've sent people to look for Yuping.

03:20.000 --> 03:21.460
There should be news soon.

03:22.460 --> 03:23.860
Thank you, Third Master.

03:53.590 --> 03:54.910
If you hadn't brought Yuping here,

03:54.910 --> 03:56.510
Mother would still be alive!

03:57.630 --> 03:58.560
It's my fault too

03:59.120 --> 04:00.780
for believing your nonsense!

04:01.630 --> 04:02.680
You said you were craving

04:02.680 --> 04:04.480
Li's sugar-roasted chestnuts,

04:05.710 --> 04:06.750
because I told you

04:06.750 --> 04:07.750
Yuping's family

04:07.750 --> 04:09.310
owned that shop, right?

04:09.750 --> 04:11.000
So you knew that finding Li's shop

04:11.000 --> 04:13.060
would lead you to Yuping, didn't you?

04:14.400 --> 04:15.840
I did want to find Yuping,

04:16.480 --> 04:17.750
but I never thought

04:19.120 --> 04:20.850
Mother would take her own life.

04:35.600 --> 04:36.800
I see.

04:38.510 --> 04:40.130
No wonder you've been

04:40.360 --> 04:41.920
acting so strangely lately.

04:41.920 --> 04:42.600
So it was you

04:42.600 --> 04:44.000
who helped find Yuping.

04:44.630 --> 04:45.630
Zhao!

04:46.240 --> 04:47.560
I was wrong. I didn't know

04:47.560 --> 04:49.220
things would end up like this.

04:49.270 --> 04:50.190
I deserve to die.

04:50.190 --> 04:51.900
I really do!

04:52.270 --> 04:54.070
This has nothing to do with Rong.

04:54.830 --> 04:55.870
I lied to him.

04:56.270 --> 04:57.120
He had no idea

04:57.120 --> 04:58.560
I was using him to get information.

04:58.560 --> 05:00.220
If you want to punish someone,

05:00.480 --> 05:02.220
just come at me.

05:02.750 --> 05:04.880
Stop putting on that act in front of me.

05:05.120 --> 05:06.000
I always treated you

05:06.000 --> 05:07.200
as my closest family,

05:07.950 --> 05:09.120
yet you used me

05:09.120 --> 05:10.520
and got my mother killed!

05:11.560 --> 05:12.310
Rong.

05:12.950 --> 05:14.190
I'm your sister, so listen to me.

05:14.190 --> 05:15.720
What kind of sister are you?

05:16.510 --> 05:18.560
I don't want a sister like you anymore!

05:18.560 --> 05:19.430
Rong.

05:21.770 --> 05:24.070
I've decided to go
to the Shuntian Prefecture

05:24.070 --> 05:26.930
and accuse Gu Dezhao
of driving his wife to suicide.

05:31.630 --> 05:32.960
Have you lost your mind?

05:34.240 --> 05:35.720
He's the real culprit.

05:36.430 --> 05:37.680
But do you realize

05:38.159 --> 05:39.870
accusing your own father is a felony?

05:39.870 --> 05:41.750
Before the case begins,
you'll take 40 strokes of the cane first!

05:41.750 --> 05:42.600
So what?

05:45.560 --> 05:46.310
I have to

05:46.310 --> 05:47.510
seek justice for her.

05:49.630 --> 05:50.560
Even if you are not afraid

05:50.560 --> 05:51.800
of physical pain,

05:52.430 --> 05:53.480
once you do this,

05:54.190 --> 05:55.240
the Gu family's reputation

05:55.240 --> 05:56.570
will be totally ruined.

05:56.750 --> 05:58.720
Don't you want to get married someday?

05:58.720 --> 06:00.380
And what about Rong's future?

06:00.830 --> 06:01.600
Don't you care about

06:01.600 --> 06:02.860
Rong's future either?

06:06.270 --> 06:08.200
I'm not here to discuss it with you.

06:09.390 --> 06:10.120
I just came here

06:10.120 --> 06:11.160
to inform you.

06:16.870 --> 06:17.670
Let me sue him!

06:20.450 --> 06:21.390
I'm also responsible for Mother's death,

06:21.390 --> 06:23.050
and I deserve no forgiveness.

06:24.680 --> 06:26.630
Let me file the accusation instead.

06:26.630 --> 06:28.430
I'll take the 40 strokes myself.

06:30.070 --> 06:30.830
Fine.

06:32.720 --> 06:34.720
Once I finish writing the petition,

06:35.560 --> 06:37.159
I'll have you sign it with me.

06:52.240 --> 06:53.630
Crazy.

06:54.560 --> 06:56.430
They're all crazy.

07:19.040 --> 07:19.720
My Lady.

07:22.070 --> 07:23.310
I was just about to look for you.

07:23.310 --> 07:24.660
A letter from Guard Chen says

07:24.660 --> 07:25.920
Yuping has been found.

07:43.560 --> 07:44.800
You are...

07:46.720 --> 07:47.680
Miss Gu.

07:48.810 --> 07:49.710
Miss Gu!

07:49.770 --> 07:50.820
I was wrong.

07:50.870 --> 07:52.170
I'm sorry.

07:52.270 --> 07:53.720
I'm truly sorry.

07:53.830 --> 07:54.520
Back then,

07:54.920 --> 07:56.920
I was the one who swapped
the labor-inducing medicine

07:56.920 --> 07:58.420
that Yun drank.

07:58.510 --> 08:00.160
It had nothing to do with Madam Ji Han.

08:00.160 --> 08:02.000
I'm willing to confess
and take the punishment.

08:02.000 --> 08:03.210
I only beg you

08:03.240 --> 08:03.920
to spare my

08:03.920 --> 08:05.270
two children.

08:05.360 --> 08:06.190
Please.

08:06.270 --> 08:07.260
Please.

08:07.390 --> 08:08.780
I beg you.

08:09.560 --> 08:11.120
Why did you harm Yun Xiang?

08:17.390 --> 08:18.190
Years ago,

08:19.040 --> 08:20.920
Madam Ji Han wanted to promote someone

08:20.920 --> 08:22.840
to divide Master's affection away
from Madam Song,

08:22.840 --> 08:23.520
so I...

08:23.830 --> 08:26.030
harbored thoughts I never should have,

08:26.510 --> 08:27.800
and even begged Madam to choose me.

08:27.800 --> 08:28.600
But Madam Ji Han

08:28.600 --> 08:29.930
chose Yun Xiang instead

08:30.000 --> 08:31.730
and assigned me to serve her.

08:33.150 --> 08:34.270
Yun Xiang relied

08:34.270 --> 08:35.200
on her pregnancy

08:35.240 --> 08:36.150
to boss me around

08:36.150 --> 08:37.150
every single day.

08:37.240 --> 08:39.700
I couldn't bear the humiliation anymore...

08:40.000 --> 08:41.299
so I gave her

08:41.720 --> 08:42.870
the labor-inducing soup

08:42.870 --> 08:45.210
and told her it could prevent miscarriage.

08:45.210 --> 08:47.340
Just because Madam chose Yun Xiang,

08:47.750 --> 08:48.790
instead of you,

08:50.430 --> 08:52.220
and you decided to harm her?

08:53.510 --> 08:54.400
I'm guilty!

08:54.420 --> 08:56.720
I deserve death.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.670
I have no idea

08:58.720 --> 09:00.320
what came over me at the time.

09:00.960 --> 09:02.600
It was as if I were possessed.

09:03.600 --> 09:04.580
So...

09:04.790 --> 09:06.790
you had feelings for Master as well?

09:07.080 --> 09:08.810
No, no, no. It wasn't like that.

09:09.390 --> 09:10.630
I didn't understand

09:10.670 --> 09:12.380
what love even was.

09:12.750 --> 09:13.690
At the time,

09:13.790 --> 09:16.240
I simply thought
that as Madam's dowry maid,

09:16.240 --> 09:17.360
I was meant

09:17.360 --> 09:19.090
to become Master's concubine.

09:19.340 --> 09:20.200
Unexpectedly,

09:20.320 --> 09:22.050
Madam chose Yun Xiang instead,

09:22.200 --> 09:24.460
and said my temperament was unsuitable.

09:24.670 --> 09:25.540
She told me

09:25.630 --> 09:26.670
to choose a servant
from the outer courtyard

09:26.670 --> 09:27.800
and get married off.

09:28.180 --> 09:29.980
I didn't want to marry a servant.

09:31.030 --> 09:32.200
So I...

09:32.750 --> 09:34.000
You committed murder,

09:34.000 --> 09:36.320
yet you were only expelled
from the mansion—

09:36.320 --> 09:38.120
you should consider yourself lucky.

09:38.120 --> 09:39.240
Then why did you suddenly come back

09:39.240 --> 09:40.360
to frame Mrs. Gu?

09:41.240 --> 09:42.670
I didn't come back

09:42.670 --> 09:44.200
to frame her on purpose.

09:44.910 --> 09:46.440
Miss Lan and Madam Song

09:46.440 --> 09:47.500
came to question me

09:47.550 --> 09:48.960
about the incident from years ago.

09:48.960 --> 09:49.780
They asked

09:49.840 --> 09:52.170
whether Madam had switched the medicine.

09:53.320 --> 09:55.050
I couldn't admit

09:55.240 --> 09:56.970
that it was my doing,

09:57.200 --> 09:59.000
so I went along with their story.

09:59.550 --> 10:01.210
Then Madam Song promised me

10:01.790 --> 10:02.550
a reward of two hundred taels of silver,

10:02.550 --> 10:04.750
if I was willing to testify against Madam

10:04.750 --> 10:06.800
in front of Master.

10:07.670 --> 10:09.310
I couldn't resist the money,

10:09.910 --> 10:10.440
so I...

10:11.840 --> 10:12.850
I'm so sorry.

10:13.120 --> 10:15.480
I made a terrible mistake.

10:33.030 --> 10:34.030
How would you like

10:35.200 --> 10:36.460
to handle this matter?

10:41.600 --> 10:42.750
Could you give me Yuping's

10:42.750 --> 10:43.950
wrriten confession?

10:43.960 --> 10:45.890
I was going to give it to you anyway.

10:46.080 --> 10:47.680
What do you want to do with it?

10:49.200 --> 10:51.530
If I take this to the Shuntian Prefecture,

10:51.750 --> 10:53.750
will he be stripped of his position?

10:54.910 --> 10:56.840
I can have him stripped of his post.

10:57.390 --> 10:59.120
Then let's expose everything.

11:00.390 --> 11:01.120
I was already planning

11:01.120 --> 11:02.650
to take him to court anyway.

11:03.750 --> 11:06.150
Are you sure you want
to sue your own father?

11:08.630 --> 11:10.290
Do you think I've lost my mind?

11:11.790 --> 11:12.550
I know

11:14.600 --> 11:15.390
that my mother

11:15.390 --> 11:17.450
wasn't directly killed by my father.

11:17.870 --> 11:19.080
And I also know

11:19.630 --> 11:21.760
the odds of winning this case
are slim.

11:23.270 --> 11:24.800
But I never expected to win.

11:27.480 --> 11:28.670
I just want to

11:29.630 --> 11:30.840
ruin his reputation.

11:31.850 --> 11:33.160
But do you realize

11:33.790 --> 11:36.360
that if a child accuses their own father,
regardless of right or wrong,

11:36.360 --> 11:38.440
they must first
endure 40 strokes of the cane?

11:38.440 --> 11:39.100
I know.

11:41.080 --> 11:42.540
But I'm willing to take it.

11:46.120 --> 11:47.910
My mother was driven to this end

11:48.510 --> 11:49.870
all because of him.

11:51.000 --> 11:53.000
I refuse to let him walk away with it.

11:58.360 --> 11:58.910
Fine.

12:19.390 --> 12:20.190
What's wrong?

12:20.550 --> 12:22.200
You helped Miss Gu today,

12:22.840 --> 12:24.550
but you still seem troubled.

12:28.020 --> 12:30.080
She wants to go to the Shuntian Prefecture

12:30.080 --> 12:31.440
to accuse Gu Dezhao.

12:32.510 --> 12:33.640
And you agreed to it?

12:35.360 --> 12:35.890
I mean...

12:36.930 --> 12:38.100
for a child to accuse their own father,

12:38.100 --> 12:39.510
it's a serious violation of filial piety!

12:39.510 --> 12:40.550
She can't possibly win.

12:40.550 --> 12:42.550
Why are you letting her have her way?

12:43.320 --> 12:44.600
She is filled with anger,

12:44.600 --> 12:46.400
and that anger must be released.

12:46.720 --> 12:47.480
Otherwise,

12:47.870 --> 12:49.000
it will consume her.

12:50.510 --> 12:52.840
But she'll have
to endure 40 strokes of the cane.

12:52.840 --> 12:54.970
Can you bear to watch Miss Gu be beaten?

13:00.030 --> 13:00.960
That is exactly

13:01.240 --> 13:02.510
why I need your help.

13:04.290 --> 13:06.230
[Case Precedents]

13:04.750 --> 13:06.080
In the 17th year of Jingning,

13:06.080 --> 13:08.240
a scholar from Zhending Prefecture
named Zhu Zhengrong

13:08.240 --> 13:09.550
accsued his own father—

13:09.550 --> 13:12.600
because his father was later found guilty
of unforgivable crimes,

13:12.600 --> 13:14.320
Zhu Zhengrong was exempted
from the strokes of the cane.

13:14.320 --> 13:15.370
Find a few more

13:15.440 --> 13:16.640
similar cases for me.

13:16.840 --> 13:18.370
I'll bring them to Yao Ping.

13:21.250 --> 13:22.650
Are you planning

13:22.840 --> 13:24.120
to change the law for this?

13:24.120 --> 13:25.920
The law is based on human nature.

13:25.960 --> 13:27.550
Besides, Gu Dezhao is guilty

13:27.550 --> 13:28.510
to begin with.

13:29.270 --> 13:29.870
By the way.

13:30.320 --> 13:31.710
Find a few censors

13:32.080 --> 13:34.130
to impeach Gu Dezhao—
charge him with favoring his concubine

13:34.130 --> 13:35.790
and driving his wife to death.

13:35.840 --> 13:37.700
Let's shape the narrative first.

13:38.440 --> 13:40.000
Since she insists on accusing him,

13:40.000 --> 13:40.930
I should at least

13:41.300 --> 13:42.890
pave the way for her.

13:43.980 --> 13:48.870
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

13:45.670 --> 13:46.720
But shouldn't you

13:46.720 --> 13:48.450
be dissuading Miss Gu instead?

13:49.630 --> 13:51.090
You wouldn't understand.

13:53.200 --> 13:54.000
Third Master.

13:54.960 --> 13:56.050
A message has just arrived.

13:56.050 --> 13:59.240
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

14:15.580 --> 14:18.820
[Wenyuan Pavilion]

14:23.750 --> 14:24.950
Greetings, Lord Fan.

14:39.910 --> 14:41.390
That old fool Fan Chuan

14:41.510 --> 14:43.390
has always been so stubborn!

14:44.630 --> 14:45.510
He refuses to acknowledge

14:45.510 --> 14:46.790
the advantages of sea transport,

14:46.790 --> 14:49.320
and insists
on opening canal routes instead.

14:49.630 --> 14:51.950
Today, the Imperial Board of Astronomy

14:52.030 --> 14:53.220
said that this year's climate

14:53.220 --> 14:54.790
is different from previous years—

14:54.790 --> 14:57.220
the summer floods may arrive early.

14:57.390 --> 14:59.190
If the summer flood comes early,

14:59.440 --> 15:00.270
won't the banks of the Yellow River

15:00.270 --> 15:02.000
and Huai River overflow again?

15:02.200 --> 15:04.320
The imperial court must prepare
for disaster relief immediately.

15:04.320 --> 15:06.910
Disaster relief is actually
a secondary concern.

15:06.910 --> 15:07.640
Come with me.

15:07.910 --> 15:09.240
Let me explain it to you.

15:10.510 --> 15:12.640
Once the Yellow River bursts its banks

15:13.320 --> 15:14.600
and the water changes its course,

15:14.490 --> 15:16.480
[Pei County] [Xuzhou]

15:14.840 --> 15:15.550
the water levels in Pei County,

15:15.550 --> 15:16.440
Xuzhou,

15:16.510 --> 15:17.930
[Suqian] [Huai'an]

15:16.630 --> 15:18.080
Suqian, and Huai'an

15:18.540 --> 15:21.040
will inevitably drop.

15:21.120 --> 15:23.030
By then, the silting in the watercourse

15:23.030 --> 15:24.320
will only become even worse.

15:24.320 --> 15:25.180
In other words,

15:26.320 --> 15:27.480
forget this year—

15:27.570 --> 15:29.500
even next year and the year after,

15:30.080 --> 15:32.480
the canal routes just won't recover.

15:33.030 --> 15:34.270
The moment Fan Chuan hears

15:34.270 --> 15:35.360
that the canal routes cannot recover,

15:35.360 --> 15:36.720
he will have no reason left

15:36.720 --> 15:38.670
to oppose sea transport.

15:39.380 --> 15:40.310
Wouldn't you say

15:40.320 --> 15:42.120
God is helping me?

15:52.080 --> 15:53.810
What do you want to see me about?

15:54.390 --> 15:55.720
Mentor, do you remember

15:56.320 --> 15:57.750
when I was attacked in Tongzhou,

15:57.750 --> 15:58.750
I mentioned that

15:59.510 --> 16:00.510
Prince Ruichang's heir

16:00.510 --> 16:03.320
had been selling
military weapons to the commoners.

16:03.320 --> 16:05.320
I followed this lead and discovered

16:05.390 --> 16:07.160
that recently a shipment of weapons

16:07.160 --> 16:08.640
bypassed the
Ministry of War's allocation process

16:08.640 --> 16:10.970
and was smuggled out through Ninghaiwei.

16:11.000 --> 16:11.840
It seems

16:12.330 --> 16:14.990
they're being transported back
to the capital.

16:16.480 --> 16:17.870
You're thinking...

16:18.200 --> 16:18.850
I think

16:19.360 --> 16:20.400
this matter is still

16:20.400 --> 16:22.100
related to Prince Ruichang.

16:22.600 --> 16:23.960
I'd like to follow the trail,

16:23.960 --> 16:26.160
let them in, and catch them red-handed.

16:27.090 --> 16:29.600
You may play along,

16:30.240 --> 16:31.480
but you can't actually

16:31.480 --> 16:32.750
let them into the capital.

16:32.750 --> 16:33.550
The capital

16:34.030 --> 16:35.230
cannot be put at risk.

16:37.030 --> 16:39.080
Then we should lure them to Tongzhou.

16:39.080 --> 16:40.780
The weapons are large.

16:41.080 --> 16:41.990
If they travel by land,

16:41.990 --> 16:43.240
they'll have to face many checkpoints,

16:43.240 --> 16:44.160
making it impossible to stay hidden.

16:44.160 --> 16:45.720
They must be taking the water route.

16:45.720 --> 16:47.010
And if they travel by water,

16:47.010 --> 16:49.470
they'll inevitably pass through Tongzhou.

16:49.870 --> 16:52.660
Then you should head to Tongzhou yourself.

16:52.750 --> 16:54.510
Come up with a proper excuse.

16:55.550 --> 16:57.550
My ancestral home is in Tongzhou.

16:58.030 --> 17:01.960
I was just thinking of returning there
to pay respects to my ancestors.

17:03.840 --> 17:04.640
Third Master,

17:05.030 --> 17:06.750
all the legal precedents of children

17:06.750 --> 17:09.150
accusing their fathers and being exempted

17:09.640 --> 17:11.440
from punishment are right here.

17:13.680 --> 17:14.960
Go to Shandong again.

17:15.240 --> 17:16.500
Deliver this letter to

17:16.550 --> 17:18.920
Pan Yuncheng
of the River Conservancy Office.

17:18.920 --> 17:20.849
Why reach out to him all of a sudden?

17:21.440 --> 17:23.400
The summer flood will be early this year.

17:23.400 --> 17:23.920
But

17:24.270 --> 17:26.109
the court will likely be unable to do much

17:26.109 --> 17:28.710
regarding river repairs
and disaster relief.

17:28.830 --> 17:29.510
Why?

17:30.110 --> 17:31.590
Isn't it true
that after the land tax reform,

17:31.590 --> 17:32.730
the Ministry of Revenue collected

17:32.730 --> 17:34.260
way more silver than usual?

17:34.590 --> 17:36.720
Is it because of the sea route project?

17:39.440 --> 17:41.240
Those are two separate matters.

17:41.790 --> 17:43.350
Surely no one would deliberately
neglect river repairs

17:43.350 --> 17:45.750
just to push forward sea transport, right?

17:47.070 --> 17:48.930
What did the Grand Secretary say?

17:53.220 --> 17:55.350
I just came from the Wenyuan Pavilion.

17:59.450 --> 18:00.750
I can't bypass my mentor

18:00.750 --> 18:03.030
and make a direct request
to Ministry of Revenue.

18:03.030 --> 18:05.160
Lord Pan and I
have worked together for many years.

18:05.160 --> 18:05.960
Tell him

18:06.720 --> 18:07.650
to prepare well.

18:08.750 --> 18:09.960
He'll know what to do.

18:14.070 --> 18:15.400
How did it come to this?

18:18.480 --> 18:19.430
Early tomorrow morning,

18:19.430 --> 18:21.110
you will escort the coffin
back to Tongzhou—

18:21.110 --> 18:22.370
on foot the entire way.

18:22.590 --> 18:23.920
How can you not eat more?

18:38.160 --> 18:39.290
That's more like it.

18:40.590 --> 18:41.200
Tomorrow morning,

18:41.200 --> 18:42.860
I will come check on you again.

18:47.350 --> 18:48.160
Yao.

18:57.780 --> 18:59.080
I heard from Rong

19:00.680 --> 19:02.340
that before Aunt passed away,

19:02.480 --> 19:04.340
she begged you to call her Mother.

19:05.400 --> 19:06.600
But you didn't say it.

19:08.070 --> 19:09.360
Now that she's gone,

19:10.440 --> 19:12.070
you must regret it deeply.

19:13.750 --> 19:14.920
But actually,

19:15.480 --> 19:17.210
you did call her Mother before.

19:18.480 --> 19:19.480
Not just Mother,

19:20.480 --> 19:21.810
you even called her Mom.

19:23.640 --> 19:24.970
Before you turned four,

19:25.720 --> 19:26.590
Aunt would return

19:26.590 --> 19:28.590
to Tongzhou to visit you every year.

19:30.070 --> 19:31.000
And every time,

19:31.440 --> 19:33.300
you would run to her from far away,

19:34.110 --> 19:35.160
calling her Mom,

19:36.030 --> 19:38.090
and throwing yourself into her arms.

19:38.750 --> 19:39.640
Then again,

19:40.790 --> 19:42.790
even if you never called her Mother—

19:44.000 --> 19:45.200
does that really mean

19:45.720 --> 19:47.920
you never thought of her as your mother?

19:50.350 --> 19:51.390
I don't think so.

19:52.240 --> 19:53.700
Because if that were true,

19:54.330 --> 19:55.930
why would you be this sad now?

20:03.590 --> 20:05.790
I'm not very good at comforting people,

20:05.890 --> 20:07.420
but I want to say this to you.

20:07.450 --> 20:08.510
It's okay to be sad.

20:09.160 --> 20:10.820
It's okay to cry if you need to.

20:12.380 --> 20:13.030
But don't

20:13.030 --> 20:14.680
let grief ruin your health.

20:15.350 --> 20:15.920
More importantly,

20:15.920 --> 20:17.510
don't hurt yourself just to punish people

20:17.510 --> 20:18.640
who aren't worth it.

20:19.270 --> 20:21.470
Because you are not alone in this world.

20:22.110 --> 20:23.570
Think about Grandmother.

20:24.110 --> 20:25.110
Think about Rong.

20:29.110 --> 20:30.170
And think about me.

20:44.070 --> 20:45.960
There are already more than ten memorials

20:45.960 --> 20:48.430
impeaching you for favoring your concubine

20:48.510 --> 20:50.640
and driving your lawful wife to death.

20:51.090 --> 20:53.220
Some of the more aggressive officials

20:53.440 --> 20:55.200
are even demanding
that you be stripped of your post

20:55.200 --> 20:56.530
and brought to justice.

20:56.610 --> 21:01.280
[Misty Waves in Serenity]

20:59.750 --> 21:01.160
I'm here to let you know

21:01.790 --> 21:02.590
and give you time

21:02.590 --> 21:03.790
to prepare yourself.

21:04.550 --> 21:05.370
For now,

21:05.440 --> 21:07.440
things haven't gotten that bad yet.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.960
But once those censors

21:09.960 --> 21:11.820
get their hands on hard evidence,

21:12.240 --> 21:14.030
you'll truly be doomed.

21:17.590 --> 21:19.710
I plan to go to the Shuntian Prefecture

21:19.710 --> 21:22.310
and accuse Gu Dezhao
of driving his wife to suicide.

21:22.310 --> 21:24.240
I'm not here to discuss it with you.

21:26.550 --> 21:27.200
I just came over

21:27.200 --> 21:28.400
to inform you.

21:34.310 --> 21:35.200
I'm finished.

21:46.110 --> 21:47.570
Do you also think

21:48.310 --> 21:49.640
I shouldn't sue Master?

21:52.000 --> 21:52.470
I...

21:53.550 --> 21:54.590
I just think

21:54.680 --> 21:56.160
Master deserves to be punished.

21:56.160 --> 21:57.440
But suing him

21:57.680 --> 21:59.430
at the cost of your reputation,

21:59.550 --> 22:00.750
Rong's future,

22:01.030 --> 22:02.640
and enduring that 40 strokes of the cane—

22:02.640 --> 22:03.500
I just think...

22:04.640 --> 22:05.640
it's not worth it.

22:14.480 --> 22:15.720
My future

22:16.590 --> 22:18.160
is all ruined!

22:42.830 --> 22:43.440
My Lady.

23:38.660 --> 23:39.410
Master.

24:02.380 --> 24:05.720
[Written Confession]

24:09.050 --> 24:10.790
It's my fault.

24:12.270 --> 24:14.070
It's all my fault.

24:15.750 --> 24:17.890
I wrongly blamed Han.

24:20.020 --> 24:23.200
I caused Han's death.

24:24.880 --> 24:27.500
It's all my fault!

24:28.960 --> 24:31.290
I planned to go to the Shuntian Prefecture

24:31.550 --> 24:32.180
to sue you.

24:33.750 --> 24:34.700
Oh...

24:41.550 --> 24:42.750
I've changed my mind.

24:44.120 --> 24:45.520
I've thought it through.

24:47.590 --> 24:48.980
If I sue you,

24:49.570 --> 24:52.100
the worst you'll face is
a ruined reputation,

24:52.190 --> 24:53.790
a demotion,
or being stripped of your post.

24:53.790 --> 24:54.750
And you

24:56.160 --> 24:57.820
deserve much worse than this.

25:01.240 --> 25:02.030
Tell me,

25:04.550 --> 25:06.610
why did Madam Ji Han take her own life?

25:08.070 --> 25:09.790
She... she was

25:10.160 --> 25:11.720
too hard on herself.

25:13.340 --> 25:16.040
She fell ill from depression.

25:23.170 --> 25:24.570
She was trapped by you,

25:25.790 --> 25:27.530
trapped by this mansion—

25:27.800 --> 25:28.890
with no way out.

25:31.510 --> 25:32.440
I want you to suffer

25:32.440 --> 25:33.510
the same as she did.

25:35.340 --> 25:36.780
What do you want?

25:37.990 --> 25:39.590
I want three things from you.

25:41.570 --> 25:42.330
First,

25:42.790 --> 25:43.900
from now on,

25:44.030 --> 25:45.240
whether you remarry

25:45.240 --> 25:46.770
or take another concubine,

25:47.640 --> 25:49.110
you must have my approval.

25:50.200 --> 25:50.720
What?

25:50.720 --> 25:51.200
Second,

25:52.160 --> 25:53.820
you have no right to interfere

25:54.550 --> 25:55.950
in my marriage or Rong's.

25:57.350 --> 25:58.590
How is that even possible?

25:58.590 --> 25:59.200
Third...

25:59.960 --> 26:00.640
Qingpu.

26:04.000 --> 26:04.920
What is this?

26:08.990 --> 26:12.150
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

26:12.880 --> 26:15.140
This is a letter of amicable separation.

26:16.310 --> 26:18.620
You want me to divorce your mother?

26:18.850 --> 26:22.050
-Your mother is already gone.
-You can still divorce her.

26:22.640 --> 26:23.140
My mo-

26:30.440 --> 26:31.640
my mother's last wish

26:33.110 --> 26:35.640
was not to be buried
in the Gu family burial grounds,

26:35.640 --> 26:38.240
but to be buried
with the Ji family in Tongzhou.

26:45.310 --> 26:46.840
Sign this letter,

26:47.480 --> 26:50.010
and the two of you
will be completely severed.

26:50.750 --> 26:51.320
This...

26:51.900 --> 26:52.680
[Letter of Amicable Separation]

26:59.270 --> 27:00.240
Zhao,

27:02.350 --> 27:04.270
why must you do this?

27:05.030 --> 27:06.770
I know you resent me

27:06.960 --> 27:09.110
because of what happened to your mother.

27:09.110 --> 27:10.910
But your mother is already gone.

27:10.930 --> 27:12.960
Divorcing her now

27:13.030 --> 27:13.830
won't benefit you

27:13.830 --> 27:14.790
or Rong

27:14.790 --> 27:17.330
in any way.

27:17.590 --> 27:19.240
As for Rong and me,

27:20.830 --> 27:22.760
you don't need to concern about us.

27:22.960 --> 27:24.110
Just sign it.

27:27.880 --> 27:30.550
I'm still your biological father.

27:31.440 --> 27:34.630
Why must you force me this far?

27:45.030 --> 27:46.310
If you refuse to sign,

27:46.820 --> 27:48.180
I'll sue you.

27:50.200 --> 27:51.110
At worst,

27:52.100 --> 27:54.160
we'll drag each other down together.

27:57.030 --> 27:58.230
No, no, please don't.

28:00.350 --> 28:01.160
I'll sign it.

28:02.870 --> 28:04.380
I'll sign it.

28:16.920 --> 28:20.280
[Signed by: Gu Dezhao]

28:34.740 --> 28:37.470
[Memorial]

28:37.540 --> 28:44.680
[Blessings Passed Down for Generations]
[Memorial]

28:37.750 --> 28:41.550
Mother!

28:44.790 --> 28:47.630
[Spirit Tablet of the Beloved Mother, Ji Han Yuan Zhen]

28:50.790 --> 28:51.760
Yao,

28:51.780 --> 28:53.440
we are about to leave the town.

28:53.440 --> 28:54.970
You should head back first.

28:56.310 --> 28:57.960
Grandmother is still unwell.

28:57.960 --> 28:59.040
The shop business

28:59.110 --> 29:00.110
can't run itself.

29:00.960 --> 29:01.880
They all need you

29:01.880 --> 29:03.740
to go back and take care of things.

29:04.240 --> 29:06.270
But it's a bit chaotic outside these days.

29:06.270 --> 29:06.770
I...

29:08.580 --> 29:12.290
[Ye]

29:19.060 --> 29:22.200
[Ye]

29:26.570 --> 29:29.000
[Ye]

29:33.890 --> 29:35.810
[Divine Mission, Eternal Prosperity:
The Legacy of the Ji Family]

29:35.830 --> 29:37.880
[The Coffin of Ji Han, Virtuous
Eldest Daughter and Honored Matriarch]

29:39.030 --> 29:39.550
Get up.

29:42.070 --> 29:43.030
Why are you here?

29:43.510 --> 29:44.590
Why didn't you tell me

29:44.590 --> 29:46.390
you were returning to Tongzhou?

29:48.920 --> 29:51.780
Were you planning to leave
without saying goodbye?

29:52.510 --> 29:54.170
After all we've been through,

29:54.200 --> 29:56.060
couldn't you at least let me know?

30:00.480 --> 30:01.140
Never mind.

30:02.480 --> 30:03.550
These are my men.

30:04.160 --> 30:04.790
I'll have them

30:04.790 --> 30:06.720
escort you back to Tongzhou later.

30:07.270 --> 30:07.770
This...

30:08.160 --> 30:09.760
They are my personal guards.

30:09.880 --> 30:11.270
The Yellow River
and Huai River have flooded.

30:11.270 --> 30:12.790
The grain shipments can't get through,

30:12.790 --> 30:14.750
and many areas have suffered disasters.

30:14.750 --> 30:15.720
Lately, in the capital,

30:15.720 --> 30:17.590
the number of refugees
has visibly increased.

30:17.590 --> 30:18.830
With this many carriages

30:18.830 --> 30:19.830
and so few guards,

30:20.590 --> 30:22.190
you'll be an obvious target.

30:23.310 --> 30:24.710
With them escorting you,

30:25.270 --> 30:26.530
I'll feel more at ease.

30:27.720 --> 30:28.240
Okay.

30:29.200 --> 30:29.800
Thank you.

30:32.880 --> 30:33.440
Rong.

30:37.680 --> 30:39.140
Thank you, Your Highness.

30:40.030 --> 30:41.510
With your men accompanying her,

30:41.510 --> 30:43.040
I feel much more reassured.

30:43.240 --> 30:44.830
Together with our own guards

30:44.830 --> 30:45.920
escorting my sister
all the way to Tongzhou,

30:45.920 --> 30:47.790
I suppose it should be safe for her.

30:47.790 --> 30:49.920
Then I'll head back to Tongzhou first.

30:49.940 --> 30:51.230
I'll wait for you to come back.

30:51.230 --> 30:52.050
Yao,

30:52.270 --> 30:53.930
take more men with you as well.

30:54.110 --> 30:55.880
Please be careful on the road.

31:13.680 --> 31:14.480
Thank you.

31:15.510 --> 31:16.240
For what?

31:16.830 --> 31:17.880
This isn't a gift.

31:18.920 --> 31:21.780
Remember to give me
enough silver as a reward later.

31:28.310 --> 31:30.510
This is the kitten we rescued last time.

31:30.680 --> 31:32.280
It's grown this big already.

31:42.310 --> 31:43.910
Alright, alright, alright.

31:49.640 --> 31:51.400
Since Baopu likes you so much,

31:52.270 --> 31:52.920
I'll let you

31:52.920 --> 31:54.240
take care of it for a few days.

31:54.240 --> 31:54.750
Me?

31:58.000 --> 31:59.000
I guess it's fine.

31:59.480 --> 32:00.070
But

32:00.310 --> 32:01.790
I'm only looking after it temporarily.

32:01.790 --> 32:03.000
This cat is still yours.

32:03.000 --> 32:04.500
You're responsible for it.

32:04.500 --> 32:05.560
When you come back,

32:05.920 --> 32:07.250
you have to take it back.

32:07.790 --> 32:08.400
Got it?

32:11.970 --> 32:13.300
Remember what you said.

32:16.750 --> 32:17.550
The weather looks

32:17.550 --> 32:18.950
like it's getting worse.

32:19.110 --> 32:20.170
Hurry up and leave.

32:41.790 --> 32:42.790
She has a sharp tongue,

32:42.790 --> 32:43.790
but a soft heart.

32:44.400 --> 32:46.260
She's clearly suffering inside,

32:46.680 --> 32:49.340
but she insists
on pretending nothing is wrong.

32:52.200 --> 32:52.830
Forget it.

32:53.480 --> 32:54.610
Three years, right?

32:55.350 --> 32:57.210
In three years, I'll protect you.

32:57.710 --> 32:59.570
I won't let anyone bully you.

33:03.200 --> 33:04.000
Young Master?

33:04.790 --> 33:06.680
She's already long out of sight.

33:11.240 --> 33:12.570
Of course I can see that.

33:19.760 --> 33:22.700
[Luhe Coaching Inn]

33:24.270 --> 33:25.240
I told you

33:25.920 --> 33:27.640
to set out earlier,

33:28.590 --> 33:31.120
but you insisted
on leaving in the afternoon.

33:31.160 --> 33:32.270
And now look,

33:32.720 --> 33:34.850
you've been caught in this heavy rain.

33:36.550 --> 33:38.150
Mother, have some tea first.

33:38.400 --> 33:39.030
Calm down.

33:39.640 --> 33:40.640
Out of nowhere,

33:42.030 --> 33:44.960
you said you wanted
to pay respects to the ancestors.

33:46.400 --> 33:49.550
You didn't ask your brother
and sister-in-law to return,

33:49.550 --> 33:51.210
nor did you bring your sister.

33:51.880 --> 33:53.030
Who knows

33:53.310 --> 33:54.880
what you're really up to?

33:56.880 --> 33:57.720
Never mind.

33:59.200 --> 34:00.880
Since you said so,

34:01.510 --> 34:03.000
I'll just go along with it.

34:04.270 --> 34:06.410
I'll accompany you back to Tongzhou.

34:06.830 --> 34:08.150
You are so eloquent, Mother.

34:08.150 --> 34:09.949
I don't even know how to respond.

34:14.320 --> 34:15.360
I heard

34:15.670 --> 34:17.030
Zhao's mother

34:17.550 --> 34:20.550
was driven to death by Gu Dezhao.

34:22.000 --> 34:23.400
Is it true?

34:23.400 --> 34:24.760
Of course it's not true.

34:26.070 --> 34:28.550
Mrs. Gu passed away because
her long-term illness became terminal;

34:28.550 --> 34:30.409
no medicine could have saved her.

34:30.550 --> 34:31.920
Mother, given your friendship

34:31.920 --> 34:32.920
with Old Madam Ji,

34:33.110 --> 34:35.030
you shouldn't spread rumors like that.

34:35.030 --> 34:36.710
Oh, look at you!

34:37.400 --> 34:39.510
I was just chatting with you,

34:40.230 --> 34:42.030
and you started lecturing me.

34:43.920 --> 34:45.520
When you arrive in Tongzhou,

34:45.760 --> 34:47.820
you should visit the Ji family often—

34:47.920 --> 34:49.400
offer some comfort to Old Madam Ji

34:49.400 --> 34:50.210
and Miss Gu.

34:52.110 --> 34:53.550
Of course.

34:56.630 --> 34:57.190
Wait.

34:58.760 --> 34:59.670
Is Zhao

34:59.960 --> 35:01.190
going back to Tongzhou too?

35:01.190 --> 35:03.630
Mrs. Gu's last wish
was to be buried in Tongzhou.

35:03.630 --> 35:04.280
So

35:05.030 --> 35:07.090
Miss Gu is escorting the coffin home.

35:07.400 --> 35:09.550
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

35:09.590 --> 35:11.550
We could have traveled together.

35:14.360 --> 35:15.110
But...

35:16.070 --> 35:17.920
it's probably for the best
that I didn't know.

35:17.920 --> 35:19.320
It saves a lot of trouble.

35:20.320 --> 35:21.440
After all,

35:21.590 --> 35:23.320
she's traveling with a coffin,

35:23.800 --> 35:25.590
and at my age,

35:26.480 --> 35:28.400
I can't bear to see such things.

35:30.280 --> 35:31.080
Third Master,

35:31.320 --> 35:31.800
Madam.

35:33.110 --> 35:33.710
Is it here?

35:33.800 --> 35:34.150
Yes.

35:35.000 --> 35:36.030
Who's here?

35:38.480 --> 35:40.940
The Ji family's
funeral procession is here.

35:41.480 --> 35:42.000
Mother,

35:42.230 --> 35:43.490
I'll take my leave now.

35:44.590 --> 35:45.120
Let's go.

35:48.280 --> 35:48.680
You...

35:52.110 --> 35:52.910
It's raining.

35:54.920 --> 35:55.450
Hurry up.

35:57.360 --> 35:58.710
No matter how many rooms they have,

35:58.710 --> 35:59.840
we'll book them all.

36:00.920 --> 36:02.460
Then ask the people at the inn

36:02.460 --> 36:03.620
to clear out the woodshed

36:03.620 --> 36:05.400
so we can place the coffin there.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.600
If that doesn't work,

36:06.880 --> 36:08.540
we'll have to build a shelter.

36:10.320 --> 36:10.840
Right.

36:11.280 --> 36:13.510
And regarding the Marquis's ten guards,

36:13.510 --> 36:15.000
please let them know—whatever they need,

36:15.000 --> 36:16.590
they should feel free to ask.

36:16.590 --> 36:17.320
Understood.

36:18.150 --> 36:18.670
My Lady.

36:18.920 --> 36:20.180
It's the Third Master.

36:23.590 --> 36:24.390
Third Master.

36:28.190 --> 36:29.150
We came across

36:29.190 --> 36:31.070
the memorial shed
that Chen family made along the road.

36:31.070 --> 36:32.600
Thank you for your trouble.

36:33.270 --> 36:34.960
Our families have been close for years.

36:34.960 --> 36:36.690
There's no need to be so formal.

36:37.750 --> 36:39.280
Since the Old Madam's here,

36:39.510 --> 36:41.510
I should've gone to pay my respects.

36:42.190 --> 36:43.670
But since I'm in mourning,

36:44.880 --> 36:46.550
I was afraid it might not be appropriate.

36:46.550 --> 36:47.150
It's fine.

36:47.630 --> 36:49.070
My mother knows you're coming.

36:49.070 --> 36:50.760
She specifically asked me to tell you

36:50.760 --> 36:52.160
not to stand on ceremony,

36:52.480 --> 36:54.540
and you should take care of yourself.

37:00.630 --> 37:02.090
Greetings, Third Master.

37:04.630 --> 37:06.110
Many people are heading
to the capital recently.

37:06.110 --> 37:08.230
Only six rooms in the West Wing are left.

37:08.230 --> 37:10.090
I'm afraid it might not be enough.

37:11.280 --> 37:13.410
We'd rather have our people squeeze in

37:14.000 --> 37:15.920
than slight the Marquis's guards.

37:15.920 --> 37:16.650
Yes, My Lady.

37:18.440 --> 37:19.030
Guards?

37:20.630 --> 37:22.160
Ye Xian sent guards for you?

37:23.510 --> 37:24.070
Yes.

37:25.590 --> 37:26.710
He said it might

37:27.150 --> 37:28.350
not be safe on the way.

37:29.280 --> 37:30.480
How many guards are there?

37:30.480 --> 37:31.150
Ten.

37:35.030 --> 37:35.630
Chen Yi.

37:37.400 --> 37:38.460
Yes, Third Master.

37:38.480 --> 37:39.840
Tell our people

37:39.840 --> 37:41.100
to clear out some rooms

37:41.280 --> 37:42.880
enough for ten people to stay.

37:42.880 --> 37:43.610
Yes, Master.

37:45.110 --> 37:46.510
Thank you, Third Master.

37:46.550 --> 37:47.510
Thank you, Guard Chen.

37:47.510 --> 37:48.150
You're welcome.

37:48.150 --> 37:48.800
Follow me.

37:57.520 --> 38:00.030
[Inn]

38:08.190 --> 38:09.730
Hurry up.

38:09.880 --> 38:10.400
Yes, ma'am.

38:10.400 --> 38:11.060
Yes, ma'am.

38:11.360 --> 38:12.280
Get it up there.

38:13.150 --> 38:13.600
Okay.

38:14.440 --> 38:16.000
Hurry, over here too.

38:16.760 --> 38:17.420
Yes, ma'am.

38:20.960 --> 38:21.560
Over here.

38:21.630 --> 38:22.760
The rain is so heavy.

38:22.760 --> 38:24.820
Everyone, be careful not to get hurt.

38:25.000 --> 38:26.200
Don't worry, My Lady.

38:28.800 --> 38:29.880
Hurry, be careful.

38:31.030 --> 38:32.090
-Over here.
-Here.

39:23.190 --> 39:24.550
Go find something

39:25.000 --> 39:27.400
to put another two layers underneath this.

39:27.440 --> 39:28.700
I'll go find some wood.

40:27.190 --> 40:28.190
Still not asleep?

40:32.320 --> 40:33.520
I can't sleep either.

40:34.630 --> 40:35.590
I'm used to it.

40:36.400 --> 40:38.860
I can't fall asleep
before the second watch.

40:40.670 --> 40:41.440
Are you cold?

40:55.440 --> 40:57.240
I'm not going to sue him anymore.

41:03.280 --> 41:04.920
I've made so many mistakes.

41:07.030 --> 41:09.090
When I first returned to the capital,

41:11.030 --> 41:12.550
I never wanted anything

41:12.550 --> 41:13.920
to do with the Gu family.

41:15.440 --> 41:17.240
All I thought about was revenge.

41:20.550 --> 41:21.360
Sure enough,

41:24.280 --> 41:25.440
I quickly found

41:25.440 --> 41:26.880
Nanny Zhou's fault,

41:28.810 --> 41:30.480
and had her beaten.

41:31.360 --> 41:32.230
Later,

41:32.390 --> 41:34.660
at Lord Lin's birthday celebration...

41:36.550 --> 41:38.550
I humiliated my father in public.

41:40.620 --> 41:42.750
Alhough I was forced by circumstance,

41:44.190 --> 41:45.630
I also intended

41:46.230 --> 41:47.880
to make a fool of him.

41:51.550 --> 41:52.590
Later,

41:53.440 --> 41:56.240
when the Liu family came
with a marriage proposal,

41:56.760 --> 41:58.760
I found a way to reject them as well.

42:02.920 --> 42:05.000
Until I found rhubarb

42:05.150 --> 42:06.550
in my mother's medicine.

42:08.030 --> 42:09.070
I thought

42:10.280 --> 42:12.410
I still had everything under control.

42:13.440 --> 42:14.280
I thought

42:14.480 --> 42:16.420
things would always go my way.

42:18.070 --> 42:19.280
So I didn't hesitate

42:19.280 --> 42:21.070
to expose the truth.

42:21.880 --> 42:23.630
I claimed to investigate

42:25.760 --> 42:27.880
and cornered my opponent.

42:29.290 --> 42:32.150
I had nothing left to lose,
so I gambled everything.

42:38.960 --> 42:40.590
Then my mother died.

42:46.030 --> 42:48.430
These past few days, I've been thinking...

42:50.070 --> 42:51.400
if I hadn't been

42:52.550 --> 42:54.030
so impulsive back then,

42:56.190 --> 42:57.710
if I had just quietly

42:58.670 --> 43:00.480
treating my mother's illness,

43:02.440 --> 43:04.360
would she still be alive?

43:14.360 --> 43:15.760
It's all my fault.

43:25.110 --> 43:26.000
Is there

43:27.670 --> 43:29.070
a song you'd like to hear?

43:43.310 --> 43:46.830
[A Splendid Match]
